TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Müziğin üstüne bağıra bağıra boğazım
kupkuru oldu!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Koca bir havuz dolusu {{TAG:0005:000E:0001}} içebilirim!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Lo spettacolo è appena cominciato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ma è già ora di scatenarsi e...
non smettere più,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Largo, largo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Quello che vedi non è
ancora nulla. Mi sto solo scaldando!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Dai, scatenati,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}The second half's just started!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The main event is still to come!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}¡Ya he llegado hasta aquí, tengo
que aguantar hasta el final!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Voy a por todas,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
